add rule inet filter input iifname "wlan*" ip saddr @DEPLOY_CLIENT_IP@ tcp dport 8766 accept comment "EmacsOS callback from deployment host WiFi"
add rule inet filter input iifname "wg0" tcp dport 8766 accept comment "Authenticated EmacsOS callback over WireGuard"
add rule inet filter input tcp dport 8766 drop comment "Reject other EmacsOS callback sources"
